---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { business } from '../data/site';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy | Shepard Excavating" description="How Shepard Excavating and Septic Service handles the information you share through this website." noindex={true}>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="prose-intro">This policy explains what information we collect on this website and how we use it. Shepard Excavating and Septic Service, LLC is based in {business.address.city}, {business.address.region}.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you fill out a form on this site, we collect the details you give us, such as your name, phone number, email address, the service you need, and any message you send. We use that information to respond to your request and to follow up about the work.</p>

      <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
      <p>We use Google Analytics to understand how people find and use our site, like which pages get visited and where visitors come from. Google Analytics sets cookies in your browser to do this. The information is aggregated and helps us improve the site. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, and you can opt out of Google Analytics with Google's browser add-on.</p>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you share to provide estimates and service, answer your questions, and run our business. We do not sell or rent your information to anyone. We may share what you submit with the tools we use to manage leads and communication, only so we can get back to you.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us what information we have about you, or ask us to delete it, by calling {business.phone} or emailing {business.email}. You can also control cookies through your browser.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy? Call {business.phone} or email <a href={business.emailHref}>{business.email}</a>. Our shop is at {business.address.street}, {business.address.city}, {business.address.region} {business.address.zip}.</p>

      <p class="prose-note">We may update this policy from time to time. Check back here for the current version.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose { max-width: 720px; }
  .prose h1 { margin-top: 0.4rem; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .prose p { color: var(--slate); margin-top: 0.8rem; }
  .prose-intro { font-size: 1.12rem; }
  .prose a { color: var(--red); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .prose-note { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
</style>
